---
import { practice } from "../lib/practice";
---

<section class="overflow-x-clip px-4 py-8 sm:py-10" aria-labelledby="sedation-strip-title">
  <div class="reveal reveal-zoom mx-auto max-w-7xl overflow-hidden rounded-4xl bg-navy p-7 text-white sm:rounded-6xl sm:p-10 lg:p-14">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.22em] text-air uppercase sm:text-sm">Comfort options at Eastland</p>
    <h2 id="sedation-strip-title" class="mt-4 max-w-3xl font-heading text-4xl leading-tight sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">Relax. We Offer Sedation Dentistry.</h2>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/75 sm:text-lg">
      Nervous about the dentist? You are not alone. Sedation is available to every patient at Eastland, and Missouri Medicaid is accepted for sedation cases.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-7 border-t border-white/20 pt-7 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.2em] text-air uppercase">IV sedation</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85">Administered and monitored by a board-eligible anesthesiologist. We verify your benefits and build a treatment plan before your visit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-white/20 pt-7 md:border-t-0 md:border-l md:pt-0 md:pl-10">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[.2em] text-air uppercase">A lighter touch</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85">Nitrous oxide is also available for children and adults, provided by your dentist during the appointment.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a class="rounded-full bg-blue px-7 py-4 text-center font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-white hover:text-navy" href="/procedures/sedation-dentistry/">Explore Sedation Dentistry <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="rounded-full border border-white/25 px-7 py-4 text-center font-bold text-white transition hover:border-white hover:bg-white hover:text-navy" href={practice.phoneHref}>Call {practice.phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
